       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       AUTHOR. LEGACY-SYSTEMS-TEAM.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY COMMON.
           COPY HEADER.
           COPY PAYROLL-RATES.
       01 WS-EMPLOYEE-ID       PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-HOURS-WORKED      PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 WS-GROSS-PAY         PIC S9(10)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-NET-PAY           PIC S9(10)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-TAX-AMOUNT        PIC S9(8)V99 COMP-3.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM INIT-PARA
           PERFORM CALC-GROSS-PARA
           PERFORM CALC-TAX-PARA
           PERFORM CALC-NET-PARA
           PERFORM WRITE-PAYSLIP-PARA
           STOP RUN.

       INIT-PARA.
           CALL 'DBACCESS' USING WS-EMPLOYEE-ID.
           CALL 'LOGGER' USING 'PAYROLL-INIT' WS-EMPLOYEE-ID.
           CALL 'VALIDATE-EMP' USING WS-EMPLOYEE-ID.

       CALC-GROSS-PARA.
           CALL 'CALC-ENGINE' USING WS-HOURS-WORKED WS-GROSS-PAY.

       CALC-TAX-PARA.
           CALL 'TAX-SERVICE' USING WS-GROSS-PAY WS-TAX-AMOUNT.

       CALC-NET-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-NET-PAY = WS-GROSS-PAY - WS-TAX-AMOUNT.

       WRITE-PAYSLIP-PARA.
           CALL 'PRINT-SERVICE' USING WS-NET-PAY WS-GROSS-PAY.
           CALL 'DBCLOSE'.
